# =============================================================================
# UK Universities F1 — .gitignore
# =============================================================================
#
# PIPELINE (run from {University}/code/):
#   scrape_course_urls.py  →  output/course_urls.csv
#   download_and_clean     →  output/course_pages/, output/clean/
#   llm_extract.py         →  output/extracted/, output/courses.csv
#   export_dev_courses.py  →  output/dev_courses_{UNI}.csv
#
# COMMIT (source, slow-to-rebuild, or import artifacts):
#   shared/                          — scripts, prompts, requirements.txt
#   _university_template/            — copy to add a new university
#   {University}/code/ENV.MD         — config template (mirror of .env)
#   {University}/code/*.py           — per-uni wrappers (if any)
#   {University}/uni_req/*.html      — source requirement pages
#   {University}/course_listing/     — saved listing/catalogue HTML
#   {University}/course_detail/      — saved sample course HTML
#   {University}/*.csv               — portal / degree-scope CSVs
#   output/course_urls.csv           — scraped URL list
#   output/clean/uni/                — cleaned university requirement markdown
#   output/dev_courses_{UNI}.csv     — export
#
# IGNORE (large, resume state, or rebuilt every run):
#   output/course_pages/             — downloaded HTML
#   output/course_listing_pages/     — listing HTML snapshots
#   output/clean/courses/**/*.md     — cleaned course pages (re-run download_and_clean)
#   output/clean/pre_setup_course/   — 10-course presetup markdown (same as above)
#   output/courses.csv               — rebuilt by --build-index
#   output/extracted_courses.csv     — rebuilt by normalize / extract
#   output/extracted/                — LLM extract JSON (re-run llm_extract.py)
#
# =============================================================================

# --- Python ---
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*$py.class
.Python
.venv/
venv/
env/
*.egg-info/
dist/
build/

# --- OS / IDE ---
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
.cursor/
.vscode/
.idea/
*.swp
*.swo

# --- Secrets (commit ENV.MD instead) ---
**/.env

# --- Browser-save junk folders ---
**/*_files/

# --- Experimental / scratch ---
**/Claude_Output/

# --- OUTPUT: large HTML (re-download / re-scrape) ---
**/output/course_pages/
**/output/course_listing_pages/

# --- OUTPUT: cleaned course markdown (keep output/clean/uni/) ---
**/output/clean/courses/**/*.md
**/output/clean/pre_setup_course/**/*.md

# --- OUTPUT: rebuilt indexes (not the export CSV) ---
**/output/courses.csv
**/output/extracted_courses.csv

# --- OUTPUT: runtime logs & resume state ---
**/output/browser_profile/
**/output/scrape.log
**/output/scrape_progress.json
**/output/failed_urls.csv
**/output/clean_warnings.csv
**/output/course_page_map.csv
**/output/presetup_sample.json
**/output/execute_selection.json
all_download_clean_progress.json

# --- OUTPUT: LLM extract tree (re-run llm_extract.py) ---
**/output/extracted/
